[size=140][u]Show Me More Trade Offers[/u][/size]

A handy Quality-of-life mod that lets you see more trade offers at once in Map mode...

[size=130][u]Features[/u][/size]
[list]
[*] Simply expand a maximum number of trade offers shown in Map mode from default [b]5[/b] to [b]50[/b].
[/list]
[size=130][u]Limitations[/u][/size]
[list]
[*] Available only from game version [b]8.00HF3[/b] and newer, due to reliance on the latest version of the [b]UI Extensions and HUD[/b] mod.
[*] Version of the [b]UI Extensions and HUD[/b] mod by [b]kuertee[/b] must be [b]8.035[/b] or newer. It is required to have access to trade layer settings.
[/list]
[size=130][u]Requirements[/u][/size]
[list]
[*] [b]X4: Foundations[/b] 8.00HF3 or newer.
[*] [b]UI Extensions and HUD[/b] by [url=https://next.nexusmods.com/profile/kuertee?gameId=2659]kuertee[/url] to be installed and enabled. Version [b]8.035[/b] and upper is required.
[list]
[*] It is available only via the Nexus Mods - [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/x4foundations/mods/552]UI Extensions and HUD[/url]
[/list]
[*] [b]Mod Support APIs[/b] by [url=https://next.nexusmods.com/profile/sirnukes?gameId=2659]SirNukes[/url] to be installed and enabled. Version [b]1.95[/b] and upper is required.
[list]
[*] It is available via Steam - [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2042901274]SirNukes Mod Support APIs[/url]
[*] Or via the Nexus Mods - [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/x4foundations/mods/503]Mod Support APIs[/url]
[/list]
[/list]
[size=130][u]Installation[/u][/size]
[list]
[*] You can download the latest version via Steam client - [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3624666582]Show Me More Trade Offers[/url]
[list]
[*] Due to absence the [b]UI Extensions and HUD[/b] mod on Steam and some limitations of Steam Workshop please be sure that you have installed and enabled the [b]UI Extensions and HUD[/b] mod by [b]kuertee[/b] of version [b]8.035[/b] or newer.
[/list]
[*] Or you can do it via the Nexus Mods - [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/x4foundations/mods/1910]Show Me More Trade Offers[/url]
[/list]
[size=130][u]Usage[/u][/size]

No special actions required. Just open the Map mode and then edit maximum number of trade offers shown in Trade Filters menu/panel.
[list]
[*] Trade offers limited by default maximum value:
[/list]  [spoiler][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chemodun/X4-ShowMeMoreTradeOffers/refs/heads/main/docs/images/trade_offers_with_default_maximum_value.png[/img][/spoiler]
[list][*] Trade Filters menu with updated maximum value:
[/list]  [spoiler][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chemodun/X4-ShowMeMoreTradeOffers/refs/heads/main/docs/images/trade_filters_with_updated_maximum_value.png[/img][/spoiler]
[list][*] Trade offers are restricted to a suitable value, though not the maximum:
[/list]  [spoiler][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chemodun/X4-ShowMeMoreTradeOffers/refs/heads/main/docs/images/trade_offers_with_new_value.png[/img][/spoiler]

